The TF2 weapon scripts of the milestone weapons, for TfWeaponScriptTests and
the weapon facts beside it: every weaponN of the ten class scripts (30
names), plus tf_weapon_builder and tf_weapon_sapper.

Source: scripts/tf_weapon_<name>.ctx in the shipped tf/tf2_misc_dir.vpk
(Steam install, sha256 b1e36819d6ae5f5f...), extracted 2026-10-25 with

    tools/vpk-extract bin/debug/content/tf/tf2_misc_dir.vpk \
        scripts/tf_weapon_<name>.ctx ... -o OUT --ice-key E2NcUkG2

(ICE level 0 under GetTFEncryptionKey(), TfEncryption.Key), then trimmed:
CRLF to LF, comment lines, trailing comments and blank lines removed, and the
TextureData block (the client HUD's sprite rectangles, which neither weapon
parser reads) dropped. Every other key is kept; no value was edited.
